    Bug 2017764 - Cache a list of all visible rows in TreeDataAdapter. r=freaktechnik

    If we squash the hierarchy down to a flat list and (importantly) remember that list until it
    changes, finding rows and calculating things is much faster.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D283994

